    "notes": [
      "INFO: SALARY MODEL: conglobated (minimi retributivi mensili conglobati per Art. 43 CCNL Jan 2025). All base_salary values are the conglobated tabular minimums; contingenza and EDR are fully absorbed. Back-calculation: Oct 2024 level 4S = 1467.86 / 164 = 8.95 EUR/h; level 2 = 1735.81 / 164 = 10.58 EUR/h; level Q = 1957.15 / 164 = 11.93 EUR/h — consistent across all levels, confirming divisor 164 and conglobated model.",
      "INFO: TRANCHE DATES: three tranches — Oct 2024, Jul 2025, Mar 2026. Renewal signed 24 Jan 2025 (CCNL 2023-2025). Level 7 abolished from 01.02.2025 per Art. 80 of the renewal; not modelled.",
      "INFO: HOURLY DIVISOR: 164, derived from Art. 50 (38-hour week). Formula: 38 h/week × 52/12 = 164.67, rounded to 164 per contract usage.",
      "INFO: ADDITIONAL MONTHS: 14 (tredicesima + quattordicesima). Quattordicesima confirmed by Art. 46 CCNL 2025 (erogata in luglio). Applies to all levels.",
      "INFO: SENIORITY: triennial (every 36 months), maximum 10 scatti. Per-level amounts from Art. 48 table (CCNL 2025 signed PDF). Valid from first tranche date Oct 2024.",
      "INFO: LEVEL Q — IND_FUN: fixed allowance EUR 100.00/month (Art. 43, 'indennità di funzioni pari a EUR 100,00 mensili lorde'). Paid over 14 mensilità, non-absorbable. Applied to all Q-level workers.",
      "INFO: APPRENTICESHIP: OSS/4S rule (Art. 22 CCNL 2020, unchanged by 2025 renewal — apprenticeship article not listed among modified articles on p.3 of the signed renewal PDF). Primary source: olympus.uniurb.it (CCNL 20 Jan 2020). Destination level 4S (OSS), 18 months: 85% months 1-9, 90% months 10-18.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: APPRENTICESHIP: Art. 22 defines variable duration and percentages by destination level (levels 2/3S/3: 36 months; levels 4S/4: 24 months except OSS/4S at 18 months; levels 5S/5/6: 18 months) and a general 90/95/100% three-band rule for non-OSS categories. The engine supports one destination_level per contract; only the OSS/4S rule (most common in UNEBA, dominant worker category) is modelled. Professionals excluded from apprenticeship per Art. 22 (nurses, physiotherapists, psychologists, social workers) are not modelled.",
      "INFO: TEP ABOLISHED: Art. 80 of the 2025 renewal abolishes the Trattamento Economico Progressivo (progressive 36-month phased salary for new hires). Not modelled as it is no longer in force from 01.02.2025.",
      "INFO: ERMT: Elemento Retributivo Mensile Territoriale is a territorial supplement, not part of the national CCNL salary table. Not modelled at national level.",
      "INFO: INPS: reuses 2026-terziario.json (TERZIARIO sector). No separate INPS circular rate published for UNEBA; rate is consistent with general terziario sector (same as Commercio and Cooperative Sociali)."
    ]
  },
